sequenceDiagram
  participant W1 as watcher 1
  participant W2 as watcher 2
  participant O as OSD (شیء config)
  participant N as notifier
  W1->>O: watch(config) و نگه داشتن linger
  W2->>O: watch(config)
  N->>O: notify(config، "reload"، timeout)
  O->>W1: notify event
  O->>W2: notify event
  W1-->>O: notify_ack(payload)
  W2-->>O: notify_ack(payload)
  O-->>N: پاسخ تجمیعی ackها (یا timeout)
